flowchart TD
    P[Provider] --> A1((2.1 Edit profile and select services))
    A1 --> D1[(Provider profile / service selections)]
    P --> A2((2.2 Upload provider documents))
    A2 --> D2[(Provider documents)]
    P --> A3((2.3 Submit verification request))
    A3 --> D3[(Verification request + profile snapshot)]
    D1 --> A3
    D2 --> A3
    A[Administrator] --> A4((2.4 Review request and documents))
    A4 <--> D2
    A4 <--> D3
    A4 --> A5{Decision}
    A5 -->|approved| A6((2.5 Activate / verify provider))
    A5 -->|rejected or needs documents| A7((2.6 Record note and request changes))
    A6 --> D1
    A7 --> D3
    A6 --> N[(Notifications / audit)]
    A7 --> N
    N --> P
